{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45066","headline":"奉和陆使君长源水堂纳凉効曹刘体 · 皎然","name":"奉和陆使君长源水堂纳凉効曹刘体","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳家陶暑亭，意远不可齐。\n烦襟荡朱弦，高步援绿荑。\n爱公满亭客，来是清风携。\n滢渟前溪上，旷望古郡西。\n六月正中伏，水轩气常凄。\n野香袭荷芰，道性亲凫鷖。\n禅子顾惠休，逸民重刘黎。\n乃知高世量，不以出处暌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}